  msgOfflineSignIn: You signed in without internet. Log out, sign in again with internet,
    then delete your account.
  msgTypePassword: Type your password to confirm.
  msgWrongPassword: That password is not correct.
  msgTooManyTries: Too many tries. Wait a few minutes and try again.
  msgNoConnection: The connection was lost. Nothing was deleted. Try again.
  msgFailed: 'Your account was not deleted: {0}'
  msgPartly: Your data was removed, but the sign-in could not be deleted. Log out,
    sign in again and repeat this step.
  confirmPhrase: Confirm Delete
  googleWarning: Confirm with your Google account to delete your GlowUp account.
    This cannot be undone.
  passwordWarning: This permanently deletes your GlowUp account, your skin profile
    and your scan history. It cannot be undone.
  phraseLabel: Type Confirm Delete to continue
  passwordLabelWords: Type your password to confirm
  useGoogleWords: Confirm with Google instead
  usePasswordWords: Confirm with my password instead
  msgGoogleCancelled: Google sign-in was cancelled. Nothing was deleted.
  msgWrongGoogle: That Google account is not the one signed in to GlowUp. Nothing
    was deleted.
  msgSignInAgain: 'For your safety, confirm again: tap Delete My Account once more.'
  msgRetry: Not everything was deleted yet (the connection was lost). Tap Delete
    My Account again to finish; it is safe to repeat.
